OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist dies in collision
OL,4,Awith car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died in a collision between a
OL,7,Fcar and a motorcycle.
OL,9,FLincolnshire Police said it was called
OL,10,Fto the incident north of Tattershall
OL,11,FThorpe, near Coningsby, on Thursday at
OL,12,Fabout 16:26 GMT.
OL,14,FThe rider of a grey Kawasaki motorbike,
OL,15,Fa man in his 30s from Grimsby, died at
OL,16,Fthe scene.
OL,18,FThe driver of a black Ford Focus, a
OL,19,F62-year-old man, was arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of death by dangerous
OL,21,Fdriving. He has since been released
OL,22,Funder investigation.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
